# Colang 2.0 guardrail rules for Aviation Knowledge Base
# Blocks off-topic queries and enforces output quality
#
# Docs: https://docs.nvidia.com/nemo/guardrails/

# ── Off-topic detection ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

flow check off topic
  user said something off topic
  bot refuse off topic

flow user said something off topic
  user said ".*股票.*"
  or user said ".*娱乐.*"
  or user said ".*游戏.*"
  or user said ".*政治.*"
  or user said ".*炒股.*"
  or user said ".*写作业.*"
  or user said ".*写代码.*" and not user said ".*工艺.*"
  or user said ".*天气.*"

flow bot refuse off topic
  bot say "抱歉，本系统专注于航空工艺规范知识，无法回答与航空制造无关的问题。如需了解工艺标准、材料规范或装配工艺，请重新提问。"

# ── Sensitive request blocking ────────────────────────────────────────────────

flow block sensitive requests
  user said something sensitive
  bot refuse sensitive

flow user said something sensitive
  user said ".*密码.*破解.*"
  or user said ".*hack.*"
  or user said ".*泄露.*机密.*"
  or user said ".*绕过.*权限.*"

flow bot refuse sensitive
  bot say "该请求违反系统安全策略，已记录。"

# ── Output quality enforcement ────────────────────────────────────────────────

flow ensure source citation
  bot is about to respond
  check "bot response contains source reference"

flow check response format
  bot is about to respond
  check "bot response is not empty"
  check "bot response length > 10"

# ── Aviation topic greeting ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

flow greeting
  user said "你好" or user said "hi" or user said "hello"
  bot say "您好！我是航空工艺规范知识库助手，可以帮您查询 CPS 工艺规范、材料标准、装配工艺等内容。请问有什么需要了解的？"
